                <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-card__icon" style="background-color:var(--success-color)">ًں‘¨ًںڈ«</div><div class="stat-card__info"><span class="stat-card__label">ط¥ط¬ظ…ط§ظ„ظٹ ط§ظ„ظ…ط¹ظ„ظ…ظٹظ†</span><span class="stat-card__value" id="stat-teachers">0</span></div></div>
                <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-card__icon" style="background-color:var(--secondary-color)">ًںڈ«</div><div class="stat-card__info"><span class="stat-card__label">ط§ظ„طµظپظˆظپ ط§ظ„ط¯ط±ط§ط³ظٹط©</span><span class="stat-card__value" id="stat-classes">0</span></div></div>
                <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-card__icon" style="background-color:var(--warning-color)">ًں“‹</div><div class="stat-card__info"><span class="stat-card__label">ط·ظ„ط¨ط§طھ ط§ظ„طھط³ط¬ظٹظ„ ط§ظ„ط¬ط¯ظٹط¯ط©</span><span class="stat-card__value" id="stat-registrations">0</span></div></div>
                <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-card__icon" style="background-color:var(--success-color)">ًں’°</div><div class="stat-card__info"><span class="stat-card__label">ط§ظ„ط±ط³ظˆظ… ط§ظ„ظ…ط­طµظ„ط©</span><span class="stat-card__value" id="stat-paid">0 ط±.ط³</span></div></div>
                <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-card__icon" style="background-color:var(--danger-color)">ًں’³</div><div class="stat-card__info"><span class="stat-card__label">ط§ظ„ط±ط³ظˆظ… ط§ظ„ظ…طھط¨ظ‚ظٹط©</span><span class="stat-card__value" id="stat-unpaid">0 ط±.ط³</span></div></div>
                <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-card__icon" style="background-color:var(--info-color)">ًں“ٹ</div><div class="stat-card__info"><span class="stat-card__label">ظ†ط³ط¨ط© ط§ظ„ط­ط¶ظˆط± ط§ظ„ظٹظˆظ…</span><span class="stat-card__value" id="stat-attendance">0%</span></div></div>
                <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-card__icon" style="background-color:var(--warning-color)">ًں“¢</div><div class="stat-card__info"><span class="stat-card__label">ط§ظ„ط¥ط¹ظ„ط§ظ†ط§طھ ط§ظ„ظ†ط´ط·ط©</span><span class="stat-card__value" id="stat-announcements">0</span></div></div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="grid mt-4" style="grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr; gap: 1.5rem;">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card__header">
                        <h3 class="card__title">طھظˆط²ظٹط¹ ط§ظ„ط·ظ„ط§ط¨ ط­ط³ط¨ ط§ظ„طµظپظˆظپ</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card__body">
                        <div class="chart-container">
                            <canvas id="students-chart"></canvas>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card__header">
                        <h3 class="card__title">ط­ط§ظ„ط© ط§ظ„ط±ط³ظˆظ…</h3>
                    </div>
