            </div>

            <div class="grid mt-4" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.5rem;">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card__header">
                        <h3 class="card__title">ظ†ط³ط¨ط© ط§ظ„ط­ط¶ظˆط± ط§ظ„ط£ط³ط¨ظˆط¹ظٹط©</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card__body">
