            </div>
            
            <div class="card mt-4">
                <div class="card__header">
                    <h3 class="card__title">ط¥ط¬ط±ط§ط،ط§طھ ط³ط±ظٹط¹ط©</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="card__body">
                    <div class="quick-actions grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem;">
                        <a href="students.html" class="quick-actions__item btn btn--outline">ط¥ط¶ط§ظپط© ط·ط§ظ„ط¨</a>
                        <a href="teachers.html" class="quick-actions__item btn btn--outline">ط¥ط¶ط§ظپط© ظ…ط¹ظ„ظ…</a>
                        <a href="grades.html" class="quick-actions__item btn btn--outline">ط¥ط¯ط®ط§ظ„ ط¯ط±ط¬ط§طھ</a>
                        <a href="announcements.html" class="quick-actions__item btn btn--outline">ظ†ط´ط± ط¥ط¹ظ„ط§ظ†</a>
                        <a href="lessons.html" class="quick-actions__item btn btn--outline">ط¥ط¶ط§ظپط© ط¯ط±ط³</a>
                        <a href="classes.html" class="quick-actions__item btn btn--outline">ط¥ظ†ط´ط§ط، طµظپ</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="grid mt-4" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.5rem;">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card__header">
                        <h3 class="card__title">ط¢ط®ط± ط§ظ„ط·ظ„ط¨ط§طھ ط§ظ„ظ…ظ‚ط¯ظ…ط©</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card__body" id="recent-registrations">
                        <div class="table-responsive">
                            <table class="data-table">
                                <thead><tr><th>ط§ظ„ط§ط³ظ…</th><th>ط§ظ„طھط§ط±ظٹط®</th><th>ط§ظ„ط­ط§ظ„ط©</th></tr></thead>
                                <tbody id="registrations-tbody"></tbody>
                            </table>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card__header">
                        <h3 class="card__title">ط¢ط®ط± ط§ظ„ط¥ط¹ظ„ط§ظ†ط§طھ</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card__body" id="recent-announcements">
                        <ul id="announcements-list" style="list-style:none; padding:0; margin:0;"></ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
